[92/545] rejected; issues=["The candidate edit directly states the gold label: 'the top rubric level' and 'which corresponds to the top rubric level,' effectively disclosing the final score/label without naming a number. This violates the requirement to not directly state a numeric final score or gold label. The corrected rationale should describe rubric-relevant qualities without explicitly asserting the highest/top level as the conclusion."]
